{"5128170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PROPERTY INSPECTION", "steam_appid": 5128170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been assigned to inspect <strong>Unit 47</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the apartment, examine reported problems, document what you find, and complete the inspection according to your clipboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It should be routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It isn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Property Inspection</strong> is a short first-person psychological horror game built around a mundane job slowly becoming something deeply wrong. There is nowhere else you are supposed to be. Your job is simply to finish the inspection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a routine inspection of Unit 47</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine the apartment and document structural problems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow an inspection checklist as the assignment begins to change</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a grounded, deteriorating residential environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-burn psychological horror focused on atmosphere and unease</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling with minimal exposition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be completed in a single sitting</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been assigned to inspect <strong>Unit 47</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the apartment, examine reported problems, document what you find, and complete the inspection according to your clipboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It should be routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It isn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Property Inspection</strong> is a short first-person psychological horror game built around a mundane 